---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { allBanks, STATES, coverage, EXAM_LANG } from '../lib/site';
const banks = allBanks();
---
<Base title="出题方法 — 每一道题都能查到出处" description="PermitDrills 题库的生产方法：只从官方手册提取事实、原创出题、逐题记录出处与核验日期。How our question bank is built from official handbooks.">
  <h1>出题方法 · Methodology</h1>
  <p class="lede">我们的题库不是抄来的，也不是从考生回忆里攒来的。每一道题都走同一条流水线，出处就印在题目下面。</p>

  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0">四步流水线 · The pipeline</h3>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>只认官方源。</strong>每州只使用该州官方驾驶手册（当前版本）和官方公布的考试格式。手册的标题、版本、链接和查阅日期都记录在案。</li>
      <li><strong>先抽事实，不碰原文。</strong>我们先把手册里的规则、数字、例外、标志含义、办事流程整理成"事实清单"——只有事实，没有手册的句子。题目只能从事实清单里长出来。</li>
      <li><strong>原创出题，自己翻译。</strong>题干、场景、干扰项、讲解全部新写；英文先行，简体中文是我们对自家英文题的翻译——不是对手册的翻译。</li>
      <li><strong>逐题对源核验。</strong>每道题发布前回到手册核对一遍，题下标注章节出处。州里换了新版手册，我们就重跑事实清单。</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin-bottom:0">
      Facts only, never handbook prose: we extract the rules and figures from each state's official handbook into a fact sheet, write wholly original questions from those facts in English, translate our own questions into Simplified Chinese, and verify every question against the handbook before it ships — recording the handbook title, section and URL on the question itself.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>各州题源 · Source per state</h2>
  <div class="grid c2">
    {banks.map(({ slug, bank }) => (
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">{STATES[slug].nameZh} {STATES[slug].nameEn}</h3>
        <p class="small" style="margin:0 0 6px">
          手册：<a href={bank.exam.handbook.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{bank.exam.handbook.title}（{bank.exam.handbook.edition}）</a>
          {bank.exam.handbook.chineseUrl && <> · <a href={bank.exam.handbook.chineseUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">官方中文版</a></>}
        </p>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin:0">{bank.questions.length} 道题 · 数据截至 {bank.exam.currentAsOf} · 官方考试 {bank.exam.questions} 题{bank.exam.passCorrect != null ? `，答对 ${bank.exam.passCorrect} 题及格` : ''}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2>题库覆盖矩阵 · Coverage matrix</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    下面每张表都由题库数据在构建时直接生成——专题题数与手册章节题数两边相加，都必须等于该州题库总数，对不上构建就报错。
    Generated from the question-bank data at build time: topic counts and handbook-section counts must each sum to the state's bank total, or the build fails.
  </p>
  {banks.map(({ slug, bank }) => {
    const cov = coverage(bank);
    return (
      <div class="card" id={`coverage-${slug}`} style="margin-top:14px">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">{STATES[slug].nameZh} {STATES[slug].nameEn} — 共 {cov.total} 道题</h3>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin:0 0 4px">{EXAM_LANG[slug].labelZh} · {EXAM_LANG[slug].labelEn}</p>
        <table class="cov">
          <thead><tr><th>专题 Topic</th><th class="n">题数</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {cov.topics.map((t) => (
              <tr><td>{t.zh} · {t.en}</td><td class="n">{t.count}</td></tr>
            ))}
            <tr class="total"><td>合计 Total</td><td class="n">{cov.topics.reduce((a, t) => a + t.count, 0)}</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <details style="margin-top:8px">
          <summary class="small" style="cursor:pointer">手册章节覆盖 · Handbook sections covered（{cov.sections.length} 个章节）</summary>
          <table class="cov">
            <thead><tr><th>手册章节 Handbook section</th><th class="n">题数</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              {cov.sections.map((s) => (
                <tr><td><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{s.section}</a></td><td class="n">{s.count}</td></tr>
              ))}
              <tr class="total"><td>合计 Total</td><td class="n">{cov.sections.reduce((a, s) => a + s.count, 0)}</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </details>
      </div>
    );
  })}

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0">我们不做的事 · What we never do</h3>
    <ul style="margin-bottom:0">
      <li>不收集、不购买、不使用任何"考生回忆"的考试内容。</li>
      <li>不复制官方手册的文字、图片，也不照搬官方样题的题序和选项。</li>
      <li>不声称本站题目会出现在正式考试中——它们是帮你学会手册的练习题。</li>
      <li>不与任何政府机构冒充关联；最终依据永远是官方手册和州法律。</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
